Thanks-- indeed that worked beautifully.

Is it possible to transfer a patient back to ward B (ICU) again if B was full at admission and patient was sent to A waiting for a bed to be available in B.

/M

On Thursday, April 29, 2021 at 11:31:28 AM UTC+2 iu...@fedoraproject.org wrote:
> On Thu, 29 Apr 2021 at 11:29, Iñaki Ucar <iu...@fedoraproject.org> wrote:
> >
> > On Wed, 28 Apr 2021 at 19:08, moleps islon <mol...@gmail.com> wrote:
> > >
> > > 2-How can i model the capacity difference in ward A during the week & weekend?
> >
> > See the schedule() function. If the simulated time unit is the day,
> > your schedule would be:
> >
> > > schedule(0:6, c(rep(10, 5), rep(4, 2)), period=7)
> > schedule: period: 7
> > { timetable: 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 }
> > { values: 10 10 10 10 10 4 4 }
>
> Or even simpler than that:
>
> > schedule(c(0, 5), c(10, 4), period=7)
> schedule: period: 7
> { timetable: 0 5 }
> { values: 10 4 }
>
> --
> Iñaki Úcar

